{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wartheon</strong> is a fast-paced 2D roguelike adventure set in a world on the brink of elemental collapse. When the malevolent sorcerer <strong>Moldran</strong> tears open a rift to steal the powers of the elemental orders, chaos floods the land. From this rupture, twisted beasts and corrupted creatures pour into Wartheon, warping the balance of nature and plunging the world into peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is the demo version of the of Wartheon game. You can still use four characters but you are limited with playing 2 levels and characters can reach max level 4.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735390?t=1747155137","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735390?t=1747155137","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735390/0d56df19996f4f25fdf1dd19a0687b85d02f8376/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747155137","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735390/0d56df19996f4f25fdf1dd19a0687b85d02f8376/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747155137","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wartheon</strong> is a fast-paced 2D roguelike adventure set in a world on the brink of elemental collapse. When the malevolent sorcerer <strong>Moldran</strong> tears open a rift to steal the powers of the elemental orders, chaos floods the land. From this rupture, twisted beasts and corrupted creatures pour into Wartheon, warping the balance of nature and plunging the world into peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is the demo versio